        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Black Madonna",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122527098884",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7271eae1-6bdd-4936-b763-b2390fb07fe7).Image",
        "Description": "Susan Wilson aka The Black Maddona has been on our watch list for some time. She has a portfolio of a govenrment official but in reality she is an ex-ICA handler. Susan has tipped many of our targets and let them get away by getting hefty sums of money. This has made us lose many agents in the field. She defected 5 years ago but now she has been spotted. She has to pay for her selfishness and arrogance to defy the ICA. Good hunting, 47.",
